WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.802
-We've been off
for a few weeks,

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:04.470
so there's a lot of news
we didn't get to cover.

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:07.240
Here to recap it for you is one
of our writers, Amber Ruffin,

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.542
in a segment we call
"Amber Says What"!

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:12.712
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:17.316
-Good evening. You guys,
things have been crazy!

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:20.452
Okay. First of all,
Beyoncé and Jay-Z

00:00:20.452 --> 00:00:24.257
dropped their joint album,
and I was like,<i> what?!</i>

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:25.725
Beyoncé was all...

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:27.861
♪ What?
What, what, what, what? ♪

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:29.462
But sometimes she was all...

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:31.697
♪ Wha-wha-wha-wha
wha-wha-what? ♪

00:00:31.697 --> 00:00:33.933
And I was like,<i> what?</i>

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:37.370
Then, Trump met with the Queen,
and everyone was like,

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:39.438
"I can't believe he was
so inappropriate."

00:00:39.438 --> 00:00:42.075
And I was like, what?
Did he touch her butt?

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:43.309
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:44.544
And everyone was like, "No."

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:47.213
Then I was like, then shut up.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:49.448
All he did was walk
in front of her.

00:00:49.448 --> 00:00:51.784
Do you want Trump behind<i> you?</i>

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:53.652
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.652 --> 00:00:56.723
What if he's behind you
right now?

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:58.558
You looked, didn't you?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:00.393
He's not back there.
You're fine.

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:02.862
Then something crazy happened.

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:06.832
Papa John got caught saying
the N-word on a conference call,

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:08.835
and I was like,<i> what?!</i>

00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:10.703
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:12.872
Caught?
It was a conference call.

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:15.542
You didn't get caught.
You got heard!

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:17.510
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:22.482
[ Applause ]

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:25.418
Then when people got mad,
he said he was --

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:28.921
and I am not kidding --
"forced to use it."

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:30.957
And I was like,<i> what?</i>

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:33.760
Someone forced you
to say the N-word?

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:36.029
You can't force someone
to say the N-word.

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:39.065
Watch.
Hey, Seth, say the N-word.

00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:40.667
-No!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:42.301
-Say it now.

00:01:42.301 --> 00:01:44.370
-No, and don't cut back
to me anymore.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.239
-Do it!
-No!

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:48.874
-See? You can't make
someone say it.

00:01:48.874 --> 00:01:52.245
Then, I heard a CVS manager
called the cops

00:01:52.245 --> 00:01:54.780
on a black lady
for trying to use a coupon,

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:57.650
and I was like, what?

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:01.987
Because they always treat me
like a queen at CVS.

00:02:01.987 --> 00:02:05.158
And by that, I mean they're
always walking behind me.

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:07.060
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.028
And...

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:12.331
♪ The black people clapped
and the white people got sad ♪

00:02:12.331 --> 00:02:17.337
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:20.673
Then, a raccoon climbed
a building.

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:22.408
And I was like,<i> what...</i>

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:25.644
are my nightmares doing
coming to life?

00:02:25.644 --> 00:02:27.380
And people were like,
isn't that cute?

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:29.849
Amd I was like, what?
The building?

00:02:29.849 --> 00:02:31.651
I guess, for a building.

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:33.352
And they were like,
"No, the raccoon."

00:02:33.352 --> 00:02:37.557
And I was like, if I saw this
outside my office window,

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:41.194
I'd ask him to scoot over
so I can jump to my death.

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:42.694
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.694 --> 00:02:44.430
Anyway, Seth, say it.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.633
-No!
-Okay.

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:49.235
Then the best thing
in the world happened.

00:02:49.235 --> 00:02:51.504
Congresswoman Maxine Waters
was talking about

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:55.207
how she was receiving
death threats and said...

00:02:55.207 --> 00:02:57.743
-If you shoot me, you better
shoot straight.

00:02:57.743 --> 00:02:59.812
There's nothing like
a wounded animal.

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:00.980
[ Crowd cheers ]

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.616
-[ Laughs ] What?!

00:03:03.616 --> 00:03:05.884
[ Applause ]

00:03:05.884 --> 00:03:09.856
I was like, what a cold-blooded
thing to say!

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:11.124
For the win!

00:03:11.124 --> 00:03:14.059
Then, an interviewer
asked Serena Williams

00:03:14.059 --> 00:03:19.132
if she was "intimidated by
Maria Sharapova's good looks."

00:03:19.132 --> 00:03:21.467
And I was like,<i> what...</i>

00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:24.269
the hell kind of question
is that?

00:03:24.269 --> 00:03:29.609
Why would<i> she</i> be intimidated
by<i> her</i> good looks?

00:03:29.609 --> 00:03:31.678
Sorry. I had to use
all three pictures

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:33.879
because I have no idea
which tennis player

00:03:33.879 --> 00:03:35.414
"Marie Sharapovy" is,

00:03:35.414 --> 00:03:37.283
and I'm slowly forgetting
her name.

00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:39.719
[ Applause ]

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:41.921
This one?

00:03:41.921 --> 00:03:44.390
I think it's this one.
I don't know.

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:47.060
Also, what are you doing
asking Serena Williams

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.762
if she's intimidated
by another tennis player?

00:03:49.762 --> 00:03:52.631
There's only one woman
we're all intimidated by,

00:03:52.631 --> 00:03:54.734
and that's this woman.

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:56.802
This has been
"Seth Says the N-Word."

00:03:56.802 --> 00:03:57.970
-No!

00:03:57.970 --> 00:03:59.805
-This has been
"Amber Says What."

00:03:59.805 --> 00:04:02.574
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:02.574 --> 00:04:05.378
-Give it up for Amber Ruffin,
everybody!

